(3, 4, "O‘pka hajmlari va ularning me’yoriy qiymatlarining to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Nafas hajmi — 500 ml", "Nafas olishning zahira hajmi — 2500–3000 ml", "O‘pkaning hayotiy sig‘imi — 3500–5000 ml", "Anatomik o‘lik bo‘shliq — taxminan 150 ml", "Qoldiq hajm — 500 ml", "Daqiqalik nafas hajmi — 1–2 l/daq", "O‘pkaning umumiy sig‘imi — 2000 ml", "Nafas chiqarishning zahira hajmi — 5000 ml"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of lung volume and normal value.",
 ["Tidal volume — 500 ml", "Inspiratory reserve volume — 2500–3000 ml", "Vital capacity — 3500–5000 ml", "Anatomical dead space — about 150 ml", "Residual volume — 500 ml", "Minute ventilation — 1–2 L/min", "Total lung capacity — 2000 ml", "Expiratory reserve volume — 5000 ml"],
 "Qoldiq hajm 1000–1500 ml, daqiqalik hajm 6–8 l/daq, umumiy sig‘im 5000–6500 ml, nafas chiqarish zahirasi 1000–1500 ml.",
 "Residual volume is 1000–1500 ml, minute ventilation 6–8 L/min, TLC 5000–6500 ml and ERV 1000–1500 ml."),
(3, 4, "Shikoyatlar majmuasi va taxmin qilinadigan kasallikning to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Subfebril harorat, tungi terlash, ozish, qon tupurish — o‘pka sili", "To‘satdan sanchiqli og‘riq va hansirash, yosh ozg‘in baland erkak — spontan pnevmotoraks", "Gektik isitma, keyin birdan ko‘p yiringli balg‘am va yengillashish — o‘pka absessi", "Ko‘p yillik ertalabki balg‘amli yo‘tal, chekuvchi — O‘SOK", "To‘satdan et uvishishi, 40 °C, zangsimon balg‘am — bronxial astma", "Ekspirator bo‘g‘ilish, shishasimon balg‘am — krupoz pnevmoniya", "Uzoq yo‘tal, qon tupurish, 40 pachka-yil — bronxoektaz", "“Og‘iz to‘la” yiringli balg‘am — quruq plevrit"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of symptom complex and suspected disease.",
 ["Low-grade fever, night sweats, weight loss, haemoptysis — pulmonary TB", "Sudden sharp pain and dyspnoea in a tall thin young man — spontaneous pneumothorax", "Hectic fever then sudden large purulent sputum with relief — lung abscess", "Years of morning productive cough in a smoker — COPD", "Sudden chills, 40 °C, rusty sputum — asthma", "Expiratory choking with glassy sputum — lobar pneumonia", "Long cough, haemoptysis, 40 pack-years — bronchiectasis", "“Mouthfuls” of purulent sputum — dry pleurisy"],
 "Zangsimon balg‘am — krupoz pnevmoniya; ekspirator bo‘g‘ilish — astma; 40 pachka-yil va qon tupurish — o‘pka raki; “og‘iz to‘la” — bronxoektaz.",
 "Rusty sputum is lobar pneumonia, expiratory choking asthma, 40 pack-years with haemoptysis lung cancer and mouthfuls bronchiectasis."),
# ---------- 5 ta to'g'ri javob, 10 variant: o'rta (1) ----------
(2, 5, "Ko‘krak qafasi shakli va sababining to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Emfizematoz — O‘SOK", "Paralitik — sil", "Kilsimon — bolalikda o‘tkazilgan raxit", "Qayiqsimon — siringomieliya", "Kifoskolioz — sil spondiliti", "Voronkasimon — o‘pka emfizemasi", "Paralitik — semizlik", "Emfizematoz — siringomieliya", "Kilsimon — o‘pka fibrozi", "Qayiqsimon — bronxial astma"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of chest shape and cause.",
 ["Barrel — COPD", "Paralytic — tuberculosis", "Pigeon — childhood rickets", "Scaphoid — syringomyelia", "Kyphoscoliosis — tuberculous spondylitis", "Funnel — emphysema", "Paralytic — obesity", "Barrel — syringomyelia", "Pigeon — pulmonary fibrosis", "Scaphoid — asthma"],
 "Voronkasimon — tug‘ma yoki etikdo‘zlarda bosim; paralitik — sil, fibroz, kaxeksiya.",
 "Funnel chest is congenital or occupational; the paralytic chest follows TB, fibrosis or cachexia."),
