(3, 5, "Yo‘tal xususiyati va tashxisiy ahamiyatining to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Hurovchi — hiqildoq zararlanishi (soxta krup)", "Bitonal — yirik bronxning siqilishi", "“Xo‘roz qichqirig‘i” bilan xurujsimon — ko‘kyo‘tal", "Ovqatdan keyin, yotganda, jig‘ildon qaynashi bilan — qizilo‘ngach-me’da reflyuksi", "Quruq, qitiqlovchi, dori to‘xtatilgach o‘tadi — IAPF ingibitorlari", "Uyquda kuchayadi — psixogen yo‘tal", "Bitonal — ko‘kyo‘tal", "Hurovchi — bronxoektaz", "Ertalabki balg‘amli — bronxial astma xuruji", "Kashlish — o‘pka shishi"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of cough feature and diagnostic meaning.",
 ["Barking — laryngeal involvement (croup)", "Bitonal — compression of a large bronchus", "Paroxysmal with a “whoop” — whooping cough", "After meals, lying down, with heartburn — reflux", "Dry, tickly, stops after the drug is withdrawn — ACE inhibitors", "Worse during sleep — psychogenic cough", "Bitonal — whooping cough", "Barking — bronchiectasis", "Morning productive — asthma attack", "Hacking — pulmonary oedema"],
 "Psixogen yo‘tal uyquda yo‘qoladi; ertalabki balg‘amli yo‘tal — surunkali bronxit va bronxoektaz.",
 "Psychogenic cough disappears in sleep; a morning productive cough means chronic bronchitis or bronchiectasis."),
(3, 5, "Hansirashning boshlanish tezligi va sabablarining to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["To‘satdan — pnevmotoraks", "To‘satdan — o‘pka arteriyasi tromboemboliyasi", "Bir necha kun ichida — pnevmoniya", "Oylar va yillar davomida — O‘SOK", "Oylar va yillar davomida — o‘pka fibrozi", "To‘satdan — anemiya", "Yillar davomida — yot jism aspiratsiyasi", "Bir necha kun ichida — o‘pka fibrozi", "To‘satdan — O‘SOK", "Yillar davomida — o‘pka shishi"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of speed of onset and cause of dyspnoea.",
 ["Sudden — pneumothorax", "Sudden — pulmonary embolism", "Over days — pneumonia", "Over months to years — COPD", "Over months to years — pulmonary fibrosis", "Sudden — anaemia", "Over years — foreign body aspiration", "Over days — pulmonary fibrosis", "Sudden — COPD", "Over years — pulmonary oedema"],
 "To‘satdan: pnevmotoraks, TELA, o‘pka shishi, astma, yot jism; asta-sekin: O‘SOK, fibroz, nuqsonlar, anemiya.",
 "Sudden: pneumothorax, embolism, oedema, asthma, foreign body; gradual: COPD, fibrosis, valve disease, anaemia."),
